    <string name="about_app_desc">Mara Lyrics he Mara community châta Mara Lyrics Team ta a taopa, a pathlâhpa nata source pahy chhielapa app a châ. Mara hla nata hlabie sâhluhpi anao kawpa ta hmô theina miah a pie ta, Mara reih nata sôhphoryh zy vaw thliepasahpa nata hmaohsipachhia nawpa a châ.\n\nHe app liata hla phu hnanôhpa - Khazoh hla, Hlâsa hla, Râh hla nata Phoryh hlazy y ta. Offline ta hlabiezy tlua nata reih theipa a châ vâta, kôcha hrona, tlyhmâna, sôhphoryh daihti nata pakhata hrona châta â hnia kaw.\n\nMara Lyrics he khizaw hmaophiatuhpa Mara zawhzydua châta eima taopa châ ta, a pathlâhpa ta hmô theipa a châ. He project he zawhzy hriana châ ta, Mara reih nata dâhzy thliepasah nawpa nata hmaohsipachhia nawpa châta eima fôpahpa a châ.</string>
